From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chad Cormier Roussel <chadcormierroussel@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 20:32:22 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] mtld3d: Metal through winemetal under the winemetal feature
 (the mtld3d-mtl facade)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

MacNeutron's Direct3D 9 on winemetal (D3D9 spec §5.1): mtld3d-mtl offers
the objc2 bindings mtld3d's Metal layer uses, under their own names, over
winemetal's Unix-call table; crate::mtl re-exports objc2 on the product
build and the facade under the winemetal feature (and off Apple). Under
it the macOS window code (macdrv, the HUD reporter, the Main Thread
Checker, GPU capture, encoder-info diagnostics) has stand-ins: views are
winemetal's, the layer is sRGB, the cursor is the game's.

Assisted-by: Claude Code: claude-opus-5-5
